    /// Computes 6 * N and stores the result in `sum[0]`.
    /// 
    /// Inputs:
    ///   - `a`: a working vector of length N (its contents are ignored).
    ///   - `sum`: an output vector of length 1.
    ///   - `N`: a positive integer, strictly less than 1000.
    ///
    /// Requires:
